{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1ba08e11-ee02-833b-a96e-c5dfe29382f1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T12:23:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Samir Singh. I have a business on Marsh Street, one ninety Marsh Street, in The Point. I am calling about the water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, Mr. Singh. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The bill came this week and it is bigger than I expected. I want to make a budget, so I need the usage by month. Can you give me a breakdown, month by month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I can pull up the account. Usually I can read you the readings and the usage for each billing period. Depending on how you're billed it may be quarterly rather than every month, so you'd see it by period. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not every month, every period. I understand. Can you send it, or I write it down now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can go through it with you now, or we can mail a copy of the usage history. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is good. Same address, Marsh Street. And also, is possible a payment plan? The whole amount at one time is hard right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can look at that. I'll put a note on the account and have the billing office call you about setting up installments. They'll go over how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, thank you. One more question. I work all week, so can I pay on Saturday or Sunday? Or online, when City Hall is closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online works any time, weekends included. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks, so you can leave a payment there on a Saturday or Sunday. Just put your account number on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the box is open the weekend, and online is always. I have it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Sorry, the line is a little loud. I am near the school, and the drop-off lane is a mess every morning, all the cars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear that. Is the best number for the callback the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Billing will be in touch. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
